		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Sleek, silver-scaled dragon- kin with a kite-like scarlet dorsal fin. Two legs, two fin- wings, no arms.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 10, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +1 (2d4) or 1 caustic gout, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Caustic Mucus</strong>. Gout acidic mucus ball within double near. All creatures in a close- sized cube around where the ball lands, DEX 12+ or 1d6 damage and are entangled in thick slime for 1d4 rounds. Cannot use again for 1d6 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
